    {
      "bbox": [
        290,
        989,
        1490,
        1119
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. Policy. It has been a fundamental policy of the City of New York to act to combat discrimination on account of race, creed, color, national origin, sex, age, marital status, sexual orientation, affectional preferences, or disability.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.251,
          "min": -0.8167
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0337,
          "min": -0.0337
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 52,
          "mean": -0.0082,
          "min": -0.3606
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 16324,
        "area_px": 155610,
        "density": 0.1049,
        "chars": 244,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 14.95
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        290,
        1158,
        1490,
        1389
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 2. Purpose. To prohibit the conduct of city business at private clubs, or at the facilities of private clubs, which restrict, limit or bar membership, or the use of dining or recreational facilities in violation of the policy set forth above. City business activities will not support entities engaged in discriminatory practices which constitute an affront to the public at large and work to the social and economic disadvantage of those who are discriminated against.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2286,
          "min": -1.2906
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 87,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0031
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 31485,
        "area_px": 276507,
        "density": 0.11387,
        "chars": 477,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 15.15
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        290,
        1425,
        1442,
        1486
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "NOW, THEREFORE, by the power vested in me as Mayor of the City of\nNew York, it is hereby ordered:",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2299,
          "min": -1.3358
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0182,
          "min": -0.0182
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 26,
          "mean": -0.0244,
          "min": -0.633
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 6627,
        "area_px": 71238,
        "density": 0.09303,
        "chars": 97,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 14.64
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        292,
        1525,
        1557,
        1756
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 3. Prohibition. No city business shall be conducted at and no city funds shall be expended in connection with any meeting held at a private club, or any facility of a private club, which does not afford full membership rights and privileges or accord use of dining and recreation facilities, to any person because of race, creed, color, national origin, sex, age, marital status, sexual orientation, affectional preference, or disability.",
